<li>In the OmPay merchant portal open <b>Developer → Credentials</b> and copy the API Key and API Secret. Sandbox and production keys are separate: enter each under its mode. See the <a href="https://developer.truepay.ompay.om/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OmPay API docs</a>.</li>
<li>Ask OmPay to enable <b>bank-hosted payments</b> on your account if checkout reports that they are not enabled.</li>
<li>If you use OmPay's IP whitelist, allow this app's server IP address, or the keys will be rejected.</li>
<li>Test mode charges nothing. OmPay's sandbox test card: 4111 1111 1111 1111, expiry 12/30, CVV 123.</li>
<li>If your store doesn't use Omani Rial, set the <b>Exchange Rate</b> to OMR (for example 0.385 for USD).</li>
